<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of 12.0 bln skr T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of 12.0 bln skr T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday it would invite bids from the market for an auction of 12.0 billion crowns worth of Treasury bills.  </p>
<p>The auction will take place on January 22, and bids are due at 1130 GMT on the auction day. Settlement date is January 24.</p>
